AI Replaces Thought argues that AI takes away human thought. AI Impact argues that AI affects the workforce.

@maxpower337.bsky.social: “AOC: "As AI begins to encroach in our society, their goal is to take your cognition away from you. AI's goal is to take your thoughts away from you, your ability to think away from you, so that you become dependent on a machine ... reading books is active resistance"”

AI Replaces Thought (77.4%) says AI takes away human thought. AI Impact (22.6%) says AI affects the workforce.
